{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the Battlefield</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break through rock formations to carve your own mining routes and defensive chokepoints. Every planet is a puzzle: plan your base layout to control enemy movement and protect your starlight drill. Choose where to build walls, place turrets, and establish power grids as you adapt to the planet\u2019s terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold the Line</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424360/extras/422474412f4a5316677fc7cd0df89a0a.poster.avif?t=1773730210\" width=674 height=646 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424360/extras/422474412f4a5316677fc7cd0df89a0a.webm?t=1773730210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424360/extras/422474412f4a5316677fc7cd0df89a0a.mp4?t=1773730210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face waves of increasingly dangerous enemies each night. Build powerful turrets, reinforce your defenses, and deploy specialized support structures to survive the onslaught. Boss fights bring unique challenges that test your team\u2019s coordination and your base\u2019s durability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invest, Upgrade, Adapt</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424360/extras/4ee25b83622df8b8d840ca8549803411.poster.avif?t=1773730210\" width=570 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424360/extras/4ee25b83622df8b8d840ca8549803411.webm?t=1773730210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424360/extras/4ee25b83622df8b8d840ca8549803411.mp4?t=1773730210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every successful mission rewards starlight. Spend it on permanent ship upgrades, mastering abilities, and stronger equipment to take on more dangerous planets. No two planets are the same, so adapt your strategy, pick the right upgrades, and stay one step ahead of escalating threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team up in 4-Player Co-op</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424360/extras/43a5b7577abde51e0d61ebb180dc980a.poster.avif?t=1773730210\" width=536 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424360/extras/43a5b7577abde51e0d61ebb180dc980a.webm?t=1773730210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424360/extras/43a5b7577abde51e0d61ebb180dc980a.mp4?t=1773730210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive alone or join forces with up to three friends. Combine unique class abilities, synergize your defenses, and coordinate your roles for maximum efficiency. Whether you're mining, healing, powering defenses, or raining down artillery fire, teamwork is key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Galaxy Every Run</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424360/extras/137d0023b3503c90bf38df8c328b65aa.poster.avif?t=1773730210\" width=640 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424360/extras/137d0023b3503c90bf38df8c328b65aa.webm?t=1773730210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424360/extras/137d0023b3503c90bf38df8c328b65aa.mp4?t=1773730210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a procedurally generated galaxy filled with hostile planets, randomized planet traits, and escalating difficulty. Each planet offers new layouts, enemy mutations, and resource challenges that keep every run fresh and unpredictable. Will you pick the right path?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3424360?t=1773730210","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3424360?t=1773730210","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424360/e6c869babb22086ec30f8e2bae5a118b6231b87a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773730210","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424360/e6c869babb22086ec30f8e2bae5a118b6231b87a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773730210","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4017530,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape the Battlefield</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break through rock formations to carve your own mining routes and defensive chokepoints. Every planet is a puzzle: plan your base layout to control enemy movement and protect your starlight drill. Choose where to build walls, place turret